    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gorilla. One hundred men. And you're right in the middle of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What happens when a mountain of muscle on two legs suddenly stops eating bananas and starts hurling people through the air <i>with</i> the bananas? Welcome to Banana Ninja VS 100 Mann, the absurdly chaotic action beat-'em-up where you, as a raging ape, tear through hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No story, no chatter. Just you, pure violence, and 100 Mann begging for trouble.<br><br>The goal of the game is to defeat 100 Mann.</p>",
